  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>application:</strong> decouple CLI availability from version detection (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/be91d8814a368dc79be3773fa8b42491ab6486b1\"><code>be91d88</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>session:</strong> reflect persisted task icon preferences in session creation (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/61440cd55d5d1f3e8a18b82622df2bc7b6fb7d3b\"><code>61440cd</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>hagitask:</strong> add task icon chooser with persisted preferences (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/a9520f295d3996a72523648497cda081a8bff81c\"><code>a9520f2</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>utils:</strong> add persistent task icon preference storage (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/b40e3ae1449994225407ad95da8f2ddbf3cc45f1\"><code>b40e3ae</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
